====== TP-Link TL-WR741ND ======

TL-WR741ND is a lowcost (15€/25$) b/g/n wireless router, capable of running OpenWrt. It is very similar to [[:toh:tp-link:tl-wr740n|TP-Link TL-WR740N]], but this model has a removable antenna.

